
# Claude Code — track shared skills only.
# Skills encode CLAUDE.md's gates, so they must be versioned ALONGSIDE the doc
# they encode: /deploy-staging asserted "smoke gate before push, not after"
# while CLAUDE.md was being corrected away from it (2026-07-28), and nothing
# could catch the contradiction because only one of the two was tracked.
# settings.json and hooks/ stay OUT of this PUBLIC repo on purpose:
#   - settings.json publishes the auto-approval allowlist (node -e, python3 -c,
#     git commit are pre-approved), i.e. what runs without a prompt
#   - hooks/guard-git.ps1 publishes the secret scanner's blind spots
#     (added lines only, config.js excluded, commit-only, fails open)
# Neither is remotely exploitable, but both are prompt-injection intel with no
# upside to publishing. They are versioned in the PRIVATE scripts repo instead.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Supabase CLI temp files
supabase/.temp/
